ss=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/John_Terra\" title=\"John Terra\">John Terra</a> (January 1995). “Reference Guide”. In <a href=\"/wiki/Allison_Lassieur\" title=\"Allison Lassieur\">Allison Lassieur</a> ed. <i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Moonsea_(accessory)\" title=\"The Moonsea (accessory)\">The Moonsea</a></i> (<a href=\"/wiki/TSR,_Inc.\" title=\"TSR, Inc.\">TSR, Inc.</a>), p. 43. ISBN <a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/978-0786900923\" title=\"Special:BookSources/978-0786900923\">978-0786900923</a>.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-Swordmage-5\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-Swordmage_5-0\">5.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-Swordmage_5-1\">5.1</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-Swordmage_5-2\">5.2</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-Swordmage_5-3\">5.3</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-Swordmage_5-4\">5.4</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-Swordmage_5-5\">5.5</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-Swordmage_5-6\">5.6</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Richard_Baker\" title=\"Richard Baker\">Richard Baker</a> (May 2008). <i><a href=\"/wiki/Swordmage_(novel)\" title=\"Swordmage (novel)\">Swordmage</a></i>. (<a href=\"/wiki/Wizards_of_the_Coast\" title=\"Wizards of the Coast\">Wizards of the Coast</a>). ISBN <a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/0786947881\" title=\"Special:BookSources/0786947881\">0786947881</a>.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-DunMag177-p81-6\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-DunMag177-p81_6-0\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Brian_R._James\" title=\"Brian R. James\">Brian R. James</a> (April 2010). “Realmslore: Vaasa”. In <a href=\"/wiki/Chris_Youngs\" title=\"Chris Youngs\">Chris Youngs</a> ed. <a href=\"/wiki/Dungeon_magazine_177\" title=\"Dungeon magazine 177\"><i>Dungeon</i> #177</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/Wizards_of_the_Coast\" title=\"Wizards of the Coast\">Wizards of the Coast</a>) (177)., p. 81.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-SM-ch7-7